CLAUDE.md
/.claude
/.vscode

# Build Output
# Covers the shipping binary, the unelevated test host, the unmanifested
# WinExe copy used to exercise the command-line paths without elevation, the
# rendered design surfaces and the log file the application writes beside
# itself — none of which are sources.
Bin/
Obj/

# Written by the application at runtime, next to the executable
*.log

# Battery reports and other scratch left by a probe that was interrupted
StarMon-battery-*.xml
